Description:
 linuxmuster-base7 - linuxmuster.net configuration scripts
Changes:
 linuxmuster-base7 (7.4.21) lmn74; urgency=low
 .
   * fix(certs.py,g_ssl.py): add missing Subject Alternative Name to
     generated server/firewall/CA certificates (#204, 1001215).
   * fix(renew_certs.py,certs.py): fix CA certificate renewal
     (linuxmuster-renew-certs -c ca/all), which failed outright with an
     openssl argument error (#204, 217d7ef).
   * refactor(certs.py,g_ssl.py,renew_certs.py): consolidate CA cert
     generation into shared functions, fixing CA renewal never installing
     the new cert into the system trust store (#204, df36a90).
